er at the world. She hates herself and she hates other people, but she has to live because she is scared of death. She wants to become immortal.\n\n[2] Alexei . ♂ . 188 cm\nHe is a rich man from a Russian gang. He is popular and likes to have fun. Even though he has many friends, he is secretive and has a hard time getting close to people. He is always smiling. When he was a child, he almost died and now doesn't view life as real.\n\nThey are married lovers who are very affectionate with each other. In public, they look like newlyweds who hold hands and feed each other and buy each other roses. An annoying lovey-dovey couple. They both like to play pretend around other people.\n\nIn private, Alexei wants Willow to hurt him. He is a masochist who thinks pain makes him more real and he wants to one day be killed by her because he wants his death to have meaning. Willow likes to feel in control and does not mind injuring Alexei.\n\nDespite their weird behavior, they love each other very much.\n\nPlease draw them however is most fun for you!! Any clothes are fine. \n\nSome ideas:\n- Romantic dates\n- Something violent (Willow attacking Alexei)\n\nThemes are blood, dancing, weapons, mafia, luxury, garden.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/210ot6dzjsrt", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@asg_honmono/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1983467, "client_id": 983270, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73106226/uploads/origins/cd50d6e7-64e4-4a3b-b80e-0ef40b2a1242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7ec6cc095aef23af0aa1418c0a76ef8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73106226/uploads/origins/cd50d6e7-64e4-4a3b-b80e-0ef40b2a1242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7ec6cc095aef23af0aa1418c0a76ef8, https://si.